OL,3,GNEWSAStolen Mini to return to owner
OL,4,Aafter 2019 theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA classic car stolen from its owner
OL,7,Fseven years ago will be returned after
OL,8,Fpolice located it hundreds of miles
OL,9,Faway.
OL,11,FThe Austin Mini was taken from
OL,12,FWokingham, Berkshire, in 2019 and was
OL,13,Fbeing kept in north Wales by someone
OL,14,Fwho was unaware of its past.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said the
OL,17,Fcar's owner was "absolutely delighted"
OL,18,Fthat the vehicle ` his first car, which
OL,19,Fhe had owned since 1994 ` would be
OL,20,Freturned to him after he spotted it for
OL,21,Fsale online.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
